OL,3,GNEWSAFamily worried over rig survivor
OL,4,Astuck in Gabon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Briton who survived the sinking of a
OL,7,Fdrilling rig off Gabon, on the west
OL,8,Fcoast of Africa, which left four dead
OL,9,Fand a fifth missing, is still not able
OL,10,Fto return home more than three weeks
OL,11,Fafter the disaster, it is claimed.
OL,13,FRichard Richardson, 68, from Hull,
OL,14,Fescaped with only the clothes he was
OL,15,Fwearing and a few euro when the
OL,16,FProspector 5 sank off Mayumba on 24
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,19,FHe has been staying at a secure hotel
OL,20,Fcomplex in Gabon since the disaster `
OL,21,Fbut he is not free to leave, according
OL,22,Fto his family.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
