OL,3,GNEWSAFamily worried over rig survivor
OL,4,Astuck in Gabon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Foreign Office spokesman said: "We
OL,7,Fare providing support to several
OL,8,FBritish nationals in Gabon and remain
OL,9,Fin contact with the local authorities."
OL,10,FRig operator Borr Drilling has been
OL,11,Fcontacted for comment.
